stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Booting
  Booting --> Halted: 정확한 원본 Missing
  Halted --> Held: actor join·ready=false·claim 유지
  Held --> Held: 같은 표본·revision·reset 거부·다른 pane만 live
  Held --> Held: metadata 읽기 실패·기존 identity 유지
  Held --> Booting: 원본 복귀 / presence 분류 / 새 nonce / 새 binding identity
  Booting --> Running: 기존 reopen·prefix 검증·resume 성공
  Held --> Ended: stop / execution gate retirement
  Running --> Ended: 기존 종료 경로
